<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_channels",
    "Makes the channel secret. Secret channels do not appear in the channel list (/list) for non-members and are hidden from /whois output. Mutually exclusive with +p (private)."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_lightbulb}>{dgettext("help_channels", "When to use it")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_channels",
    "Use it when the existence of the channel itself should stay hidden. Only people who already know the exact name can find it. Combine it with invite-only mode or a key to also control who may enter."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_terminal}>{dgettext("help_channels", "Usage")}</.help_h4>
<pre>/mode +s  {dgettext("help_channels", "Make channel secret")}
/mode -s  {dgettext("help_channels", "Remove secret mode")}</pre>
<p>
  {dgettext(
    "help_channels",
    "The command changes the channel you are looking at. You do not type the channel name."
  )}
</p>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_lightbulb}>{dgettext("help_channels", "What stays hidden")}</.help_h4>
<ul>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_channels",
      "The Channel List shows no row at all for the channel to people who are not in it."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_channels",
      "When someone looks up a member with whois or the hover card, the channel is left out unless the viewer is in it too."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_channels",
      "Share links and link previews do not show the channel name."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_channels",
      "A secret channel cannot have a public archive. A published archive stops being public when the channel becomes secret."
    )}
  </li>
</ul>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_rules}>{dgettext("help_channels", "Rules and limits")}</.help_h4>
<ul>
  <li>
    {dgettext("help_channels", "Only channel operators and owners can set or remove this mode.")}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_channels",
      "Secret mode does not stop anyone from joining. A person who types the name can still enter."
    )}
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_channels",
      "A channel cannot be secret and private at the same time. To switch, remove private mode first, then set secret mode:"
    )} <code>/mode -p</code> <code>/mode +s</code>
  </li>
  <li>
    {dgettext(
      "help_channels",
      "In a registered channel the mode is saved and comes back after a restart."
    )}
  </li>
</ul>
<.help_h4 icon={:icon_link}>{dgettext("help_channels", "See Also")}</.help_h4>
<p>
  <.help_link topic="mode-p">{dgettext("help_channels", "Private (+p)")}</.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="mode-i">{dgettext("help_channels", "Invite Only")}</.help_link>
  · <.help_link topic="cmd-list">{dgettext("help_channels", "Channel List")}</.help_link>
  ·
  <.help_link topic="feature-public-archive">
    {dgettext("help_channels", "Public Archive")}
  </.help_link>
</p>
